# Pacemaker CLI Utilities global configuration.
# This file sets default options applied to all pacemaker command-line utilities
# (crmsh, pcs, cibadmin, etc.) via the OPTIONS environment variable.
#
# See `man crmsh` or `man pcs` for a full list of available flags.
# For example, '-d' enables debug output.
#
# The variable 'options' should contain a string of whitespace-separated flags.
# Example: options = '-d -f'

# Default: -d
# Description: Command-line options for pacemaker-cli-utils commands.
OPTIONS="{{ options | default('-d') | string }}"